# This repo is a PUBLIC GitHub Pages site (clocal.co.uk) -- every file
# tracked here becomes a real, live, crawlable URL the instant it's
# pushed, whether or not it was meant to be public. Found the hard way
# 2026-09-13: 13 internal Supabase security scripts, a plaintext demo
# password, and a Flutter theme file sat live on clocal.co.uk for weeks
# because nothing here blocked them and a broad `git add -A` swept them
# in alongside real website changes. Never commit any of the below to
# this repo -- if you need to reference them, keep them outside this
# folder entirely (e.g. in the CLocal app repo, which is private).
supabase/
*.sql
*access-code*
*password*
clocal_theme.dart
CLAUDE_SESSION*.md

# Draft ad creative and mocks -- large, unreleased, not meant to be
# public yet. Sits alongside real site files in assets/, so a broad
# `git add -A` will sweep it in unless this stays here.
assets/ads/
